\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {7}{\ignorespaces \textbf  {Multi-order $100\%$ ground-state synthesis ($n=3\dots  10$) and nullspace dimensional relief.} \textbf  {(a)} Mean restarts (magenta, left axis) and mean $O(1)$ incremental $2$-cycle descent loops (blue dashed, right axis) required by Multi-Exchange Iterated Local Search (ME-ILS) to reach $\mathcal  {H}_{\mathrm  {line}}= 0$ with $100.0\%$ success across orders $n=3\dots  10$ (\Cref  {tab:multi_order_settler}). Combinatorial frustration peaks at $n=5$ ($\eta _{\mathrm  {MC}} = 1.40$: $8.03$ restarts, $466.6$ descents) and declines across $n=6\dots  10$ ($3.34$ restarts and $258.5$ descents at $n=10$) as the diagonal-free $(2,2)$ subspace fraction $f_{\mathrm  {null}}(n) = 1 - 2/(n-1)^2$ reaches $97.5\%$. \textbf  {(b)} Quadratic expansion of the magic nullspace $\dim \ker (\setbox \z@ \hbox {\mathsurround \z@ $\textstyle L$}\mathaccent "0365{L}_n) = n^2-2n-1$ (green bars, labeled with $\eta _{\mathrm  {MC}}$) versus linear growth of the constraint rank $\operatorname  {rank}(\setbox \z@ \hbox {\mathsurround \z@ $\textstyle L$}\mathaccent "0365{L}_n)=2n$ (blue bars) and mean synthesis runtime per square (orange curve, right axis).}}{17}{figure.74}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:dimensional_relief}{{7}{17}{\textbf {Multi-order $100\%$ ground-state synthesis ($n=3\dots 10$) and nullspace dimensional relief.} \textbf {(a)} Mean restarts (magenta, left axis) and mean $O(1)$ incremental $2$-cycle descent loops (blue dashed, right axis) required by Multi-Exchange Iterated Local Search (ME-ILS) to reach $\Hline = 0$ with $100.0\%$ success across orders $n=3\dots 10$ (\Cref {tab:multi_order_settler}). Combinatorial frustration peaks at $n=5$ ($\eta _{\mathrm {MC}} = 1.40$: $8.03$ restarts, $466.6$ descents) and declines across $n=6\dots 10$ ($3.34$ restarts and $258.5$ descents at $n=10$) as the diagonal-free $(2,2)$ subspace fraction $f_{\mathrm {null}}(n) = 1 - 2/(n-1)^2$ reaches $97.5\%$. \textbf {(b)} Quadratic expansion of the magic nullspace $\dim \ker (\Ltilde _n) = n^2-2n-1$ (green bars, labeled with $\eta _{\mathrm {MC}}$) versus linear growth of the constraint rank $\operatorname {rank}(\Ltilde _n)=2n$ (blue bars) and mean synthesis runtime per square (orange curve, right axis)}{figure.74}{}}
